---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
const pageTitle = "About Me";
---
<Layout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
    <div class="gif">
        <img width="300" height="259" alt="RaccoonLaptopGif" src="/blog.webp"/>
    </div>
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>
        My name is Ash Hong, a MEng student at MIT pursuing Computer Science and Engineering. 
        My primary interests involve game development, 3D modeling, and website development. 
        I have experience with Python, Java, C#, C/C++, Assembly, HTML/CSS, Typescript, Verilog, and GSC.
        My other hobbies include Dungeons & Dragons, narrative writing, and digital art. 
    </p>

    <p>
        I am a former Tech Design intern at Treyarch and I am currently working on my master's thesis
        with the MIT LEAP Group. My research is focused on understanding the influence and impact of 
        serious games on career and educational aspirations in gamers. The research currently entails using 
        the Steam Web API to scrape thousands of games and comments, using user-based community tags 
        as a filter for relevancy.
    </p>

    <p>
        Feel free to reach out to me using my socials below!
    </p>
</Layout>

